@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ v21.5.25-p3i.4 (2026-10-31)
 - Fix the last frame of a TS segment or stream whose parameter sets came in a PES of their own, which was read as two frames
 - Fix a seek in a TS stream to a key frame whose picture PES starts in the next segment, which returned that key frame twice
 - Fix a live seek in a TS stream that waited more than once for the next segment, which lost audio frames of an audio PES across the two segments
+- Fix the timestamps of TS audio in PES packets without a PTS at the start and after a seek, which had no PTS up to the next PES with a PTS, and of a key frame in a PES without a PTS after a seek, which took the PTS of a later frame
 - Fix a TS AAC stream with a corrupt ADTS header whose frame length is shorter than the header, which stopped the playback in an endless loop or sent a corrupt frame
 - Fix the segment times of HLS streams with EXTINF durations finer than 1 ms, which drifted from the media time (0.24 s after one hour of a YouTube stream), so a seek near a segment start could continue at the next segment
 
